{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive **International Reach / Personal Service section** for the DocMed About Us page based on the attached visual reference.
    
    The section should use a clean **two-column layout on desktop**. The **text content must remain on the left**, but instead of the icon/customer grid shown in the reference, place a **large image on the right side**.
    
    I will provide the final image separately. **Do not generate an image.**
    
    ### Desktop layout
    
    Use the existing DocMed content container and standard page width.
    
    **Left column – Text**
    
    * Approximately **52–55% width**
    * Left aligned
    * Vertically centered relative to the image
    
    Display the following content:
    
    Small uppercase eyebrow:
    
    **INTERNATIONALE REICHWEITE. PERSÖNLICHER SERVICE.**
    
    Main headline:
    
    **Unterschiedliche Bedürfnisse.
    Eine gemeinsame Lösung.**
    
    Body copy:
    
    Unsere Kunden sind vielfältig, und das sind auch ihre Bedürfnisse. Ein Krankenhaus hat andere Anforderungen als ein Distributor. Eine Arztpraxis hat andere Prioritäten als ein privater Kunde.
    
    Wir verstehen diese Unterschiede.
    
    Unsere digitalen und effizienten Prozesse ermöglichen es uns, über Märkte hinweg zu operieren und schnell zu reagieren, während unser persönlicher Ansatz uns nah bei den Menschen und Organisationen, denen wir dienen, hält.
    
    Ob eine Anforderung unkompliziert oder komplexer ist, unser Ziel ist es, die Zusammenarbeit mit DocMed einfach, reaktiv und zuverlässig zu gestalten.
    
    Denn egal wie weit unsere Reichweite sich erstreckt, unsere Kunden fühlen sich niemals wie nur eine weitere Bestellnummer. Wir glauben, dass langfristige Beziehungen durch Vertrauen, Zuverlässigkeit und echtes Verständnis dafür aufgebaut werden, was unsere Kunden brauchen.
    
    ### Right column – Image
    
    Replace the complete customer/icon grid from the reference with **one large image**.
    
    * Approximately **42–45% width**
    * Image should visually balance the height of the text column
    * Use a large rectangular landscape/portrait-balanced format
    * Slightly rounded corners matching the existing DocMed design
    * `object-fit: cover`
    * No distortion or stretching
    * Keep the relevant image subject visible when cropping
    * Do not add text, icons or graphics on top of the image
    * No strong shadow
    * The image should be editable through a Shopify image picker
    
    I will select and upload the final image later.
    
    ### Background and visual style
    
    Use a **very subtle light blue / white background**, similar to the reference.
    
    The section should visually alternate from the previous white section without creating a strong visual break.
    
    Use:
    
    * Dark DocMed navy for headline and body text
    * DocMed blue for the eyebrow
    * Existing DocMed typography
    * Existing theme border radius
    * Generous whitespace
    * Clean medical/corporate appearance
    
    Do not add:
    
    * CTA buttons
    * Customer cards
    * Icons
    * Statistics
    * Decorative graphics
    * Additional text
    
    ### Typography
    
    The eyebrow should be small, uppercase and blue.
    
    The headline should be bold and significantly larger than the body text:
    
    **Unterschiedliche Bedürfnisse.
    Eine gemeinsame Lösung.**
    
    Keep the intended two-line headline on larger screens where possible.
    
    Body paragraphs should have comfortable line-height and clear vertical spacing.
    
    The sentence:
    
    **Wir verstehen diese Unterschiede.**
    
    should remain its own paragraph.
    
    ### Desktop spacing
    
    Use approximately:
    
    * 52–55% text
    * 42–45% image
    * 40–60 px gap between columns
    
    Vertically center the image and text areas.
    
    Do not use a fixed section height. The section should grow naturally based on the content.
    
    Maintain consistent top and bottom padding with the other About Us sections.
    
    ### Responsive behavior
    
    The section must be fully responsive across desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    #### Desktop
    
    * Two columns
    * Text left
    * Image right
    * Vertically centered
    * Image should have enough height to visually balance the relatively long text
    * Respect the theme's maximum content width
    
    #### Tablet
    
    Keep the two-column layout only while both columns remain comfortably readable.
    
    Reduce:
    
    * Column gap
    * Section padding
    * Headline size
    * Image width proportionally
    
    Do **not** squeeze the text into an excessively narrow column.
    
    Once the available width is insufficient, automatically switch to the stacked layout.
    
    #### Mobile
    
    Switch to **one column**.
    
    The order on mobile should be:
    
    1. Eyebrow
    2. Headline
    3. Body text
    4. Image
    
    The text therefore appears **first** and the image **underneath** on mobile.
    
    Mobile image:
    
    * Width: 100%
    * Appropriate mobile aspect ratio
    * Avoid excessive image height
    * `object-fit: cover`
    * Rounded corners
    * Preserve the selected focal point
    
    Mobile typography:
    
    * Everything left aligned
    * Scale headline down fluidly
    * Maintain clear hierarchy
    * Body text must remain easily readable
    * Reduce paragraph spacing slightly compared with desktop
    * Use the existing mobile page margins
    
    There must be:
    
    * No horizontal scrolling
    * No overlapping content
    * No clipped text
    * No distorted image
    * No excessively small typog
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};}
.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:{{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;margin:0 auto;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.18fr) minmax(0,.92fr);gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;align-items:center;}
.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{min-width:0;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;line-height:1.4;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{max-width:680px;margin:0 0 28px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.heading_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,3.4vw,{{ block.settings.heading_size }}px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.12;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{max-width:720px;color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:{{ block.settings.body_size }}px;line-height:1.75;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body p{margin:0 0 18px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{width:100%;aspect-ratio:.92/1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:{{ block.settings.image_position }};}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:360px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#e8f2f5;color:#526875;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;max-width:420px;max-height:420px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state{position:absolute;right:20px;bottom:18px;left:20px;margin:0;color:#526875;font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-align:center;}
@media screen and (max-width:989px){.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:92%;gap:30px;padding:55px 0;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin-bottom:22px;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;}}
@media screen and (max-width:749px){.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:100%;padding:45px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:30px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin-bottom:14px;font-size:11px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin-bottom:20px;font-size:clamp(29px,8vw,38px);line-height:1.16;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{font-size:15px;line-height:1.68;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body p{margin-bottom:15px;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{aspect-ratio:1.12/1;}.ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{min-height:280px;}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content"><p class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">INTERNATIONALE REICHWEITE. PERSÖNLICHER SERVICE.</p><h2 class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">Unterschiedliche Bedürfnisse.<br>Eine gemeinsame Lösung.</h2><div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body"><p>Unsere Kunden sind vielfältig, und das sind auch ihre Bedürfnisse. Ein Krankenhaus hat andere Anforderungen als ein Distributor. Eine Arztpraxis hat andere Prioritäten als ein privater Kunde.</p><p>Wir verstehen diese Unterschiede.</p><p>Unsere digitalen und effizienten Prozesse ermöglichen es uns, über Märkte hinweg zu operieren und schnell zu reagieren, während unser persönlicher Ansatz uns nah bei den Menschen und Organisationen, denen wir dienen, hält.</p><p>Ob eine Anforderung unkompliziert oder komplexer ist, unser Ziel ist es, die Zusammenarbeit mit DocMed einfach, reaktiv und zuverlässig zu gestalten.</p><p>Denn egal wie weit unsere Reichweite sich erstreckt, unsere Kunden fühlen sich niemals wie nur eine weitere Bestellnummer. Wir glauben, dass langfristige Beziehungen durch Vertrauen, Zuverlässigkeit und echtes Verständnis dafür aufgebaut werden, was unsere Kunden brauchen.</p></div></div><div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">{% if block.settings.image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<p class="ai-international-reach-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state">Wähle ein Bild für diesen Bereich aus.</p></div>{% endif %}</div></div></div>
{% schema %}{"name":"International reach","settings":[{"type":"image_picker","id":"image","label":"Image"},{"type":"select","id":"image_position","label":"Image focal point","options":[{"value":"center center","label":"Center"},{"value":"center top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center bottom","label":"Bottom"},{"value":"left center","label":"Left"},{"value":"right center","label":"Right"}],"default":"center center"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"max_content_width","label":"Content width","min":1000,"max":1800,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1500},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column gap","min":40,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":55},{"type":"range","id":"padding_vertical","label":"Vertical padding","min":30,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":70},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Heading size","min":36,"max":64,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":52},{"type":"range","id":"body_size","label":"Body size","min":14,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"image_radius","label":"Image radius","min":0,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},{"type":"font_picker","id":"heading_font","label":"Heading font","default":"poppins_n4"},{"type":"font_picker","id":"body_font","label":"Body font","default":"manrope_n4"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#F4FAFC"},{"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow","default":"#126FD3"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"color","id":"body_color","label":"Body","default":"#1D2E40"}],"presets":[{"name":"International reach"}],"tag":null,"class":"international-reach-block"}{% endschema %}